    "content": {
      "body": "# Edit a file and check the edit\n\nEdit a file and check the edit. Use when a task changes one file and the change must be seen to have applied.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. I make the change in {source-file}.\n\n   ```\n   edit({\"path\":\"{source-file}\"})\n   ```\n\n2. I read {source-file} again to check that the edit applied, rather than retrying a shell edit.\n\n   ```\n   read({\"path\":\"{source-file}\"})\n   ```\n",
      "tools": [
        "edit",
        "read"
      ]
    }
